      "content": "that makes sense. i'll try the breathing stuff. do you think there is anything else i should do to make sure the data they're getting is useless? like, would wearing certain types of fabric or maybe using a specific posture could interfere with the sensor's accuracy so they can't actually tell what's going on with my body? i really need to make sure they can't build a clear profile.",
